eccak256(abi.encodePacked(\n          \"\\x19Ethereum Signed Message:\\n32\",\n          keccak256(abi.encodePacked(userOpHash, validUntil, validAfter))\n      ));\n\n      (address recovered, ECDSA.RecoverError recoverError, bytes32 errorArg) =\n          ECDSA.tryRecover(hash, signature);\n      // ... remainder unchanged\n  }\n\n  This ensures that stripping or modifying the time-window bytes invalidates the ECDSA signature, making the two formats cryptographically distinct.\n\n ## Assessed type\n\n  Access Control",
